    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007 read with Article 44(2)of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Mahinda Rajapaksa, President of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order impose in respect of the commodity items specified in Column I of the Schedulehereto a Special Commodity Levy, at the rates specified in the corresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule. This ordershall be valid for a period of 04 months commencing from 02nd December 2014, subject to provisions of sub-Section (3) ofSection 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007.",
